Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason you've kept that woman's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.48,0:00:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't quite understand why.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.34,0:00:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And then all that trouble with Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It may cost your friend Kate her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What we do with you will be decided later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we've got that infamous head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a guarantee that it's gone.
